export anchor ArtNouveauStyle:
    number: 62
    screen: Calendar
    name: Art nouveau
    idea: The week as seven arched gallery windows inside a gilded frame, with whiplash flourishes, a lancet side panel and soft greens and golds.
    base: light
    palette:
        paleSage: #eef0e4, the page around the frame
        ivory: #fbfaf2, the frame, windows and fields
        forest: #23402e, text, the primary button and the today window border
        moss: #4a634a, labels, people and day names
        oldGold: #806217, times, the outer frame line and focus
        gilt: #c3a250, ornaments and inner rules only
        goldLeaf: #f3ead0, the selected view, the lancet glow and the focus halo
        plum: #6b2d4a, Deadline entries on #f6ecf0
        dusk: #3e5566, Out of office entries
    type:
        Display high contrast serif for headings, numerals and entry titles,
        Didot, Bodoni 72, Bodoni MT, Big Caslon, Cochin, Baskerville, Georgia,
        serif. Body in a flared humanist sans, Optima, Candara, Segoe UI, Noto
        Sans, Gill Sans, sans-serif. Sizes are 30px for the week title with a
        15px italic subtitle, 36px day numerals, 17px entry titles, 12px
        uppercase day names with 0.1em tracking, 13px italic people and 12px
        bold gold times.
    layout:
        The whole screen sits in an ivory frame with a double gold rule and
        whiplash corner ornaments. A centred masthead shows the spaced
        uppercase wordmark between two whiplash flourishes, a centred
        uppercase nav with fleurons around the current item, and Mara at the
        top right. The week title and controls sit between two gilt rules. A
        230px lancet panel on the left, arched at the top, holds the month,
        the calendar checkboxes and the away note. The week is seven tall
        arched windows in one row, each with the day name, a large numeral, a
        small ornament and its entries centred and divided by gilt rules. The
        today window has a thicker forest border, a gold leaf glow and a
        Today ribbon. Below 1240px the windows wrap, below 900px the lancet
        moves under them, and below 640px the windows stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 14px between windows, about 44px arch headroom, 12px between entries and 32px between areas.
    density: Ceremonial. Seven tall windows and centred, generously spaced entries.
    corners: Semi elliptical arch tops on windows and the lancet. Buttons and fields use leaf corners of 20px and 4px.
    borders: Double rules everywhere, a 1.5px old gold line with a 1px gilt line inset 5 to 8px. Deadline entries get a plum line and an arched top, out of office a dashed dusk line.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from inset double rules and the gold leaf gradient.
    icons:
        Botanical line icons at text size with a 1.5 stroke. A four petal
        flower marks Team, a diamond marks Deadline and an arched door marks
        Out of office, each with its word. Today in the month is a filled
        forest seal.
    focus: A 2px old gold outline offset 3px with a 6px gold leaf halo.
    tone: Formal and graceful, such as The Week of the Second of November and A quiet day, nothing planned.
